{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":30979615,"ns":0,"title":"Ahlfors finiteness theorem","extract":"In the mathematical theory of Kleinian groups, the Ahlfors finiteness theorem describes the quotient of the domain of discontinuity by a finitely generated Kleinian group. The theorem was proved by Lars Ahlfors, apart from a gap that was filled by Greenberg.","description":"Mathematical theory","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}